meta-luneos-backports-6.1
=========================

Recipes taken from oe-core/meta-openembedded *blacksail* (Yocto 6.1) while the
rest of the build is on *wrynose* (Yocto 6.0). This is the opposite direction
to meta-luneos-holdbacks-*, which holds recipes back to an older release --
hence the different name. Everything here is a verbatim copy from the newer
branch unless noted, so a recipe can simply be deleted once wrynose carries it.

LuneOS-specific configuration does NOT belong here: that stays in a bbappend in
meta-luneos, so what we override and what we merely carry early stay separate.

Contents
--------

recipes-devtools/go
    go 1.27.2, from oe-core 6d8e62502a ("go: upgrade 1.27.1 -> 1.27.2").
    wrynose is still on 1.26.5, whose _rt0_arm_lib misaligns the stack on
    armv7 when it calls into C (golang/go#58548, fixed in 1.27), so a Go
    c-shared library such as purple-combined's dies with SIGBUS. Selected with
    GOVERSION in meta-luneos's luneos-preferred-versions.inc.

recipes-devtools/android-tools, recipes-devtools/android-libboringssl
    android-tools 35.0.2 (adb, adbd, fastboot, img2simg, simg2img,
    mkbootimg.py) and android-tools-conf, with the BoringSSL they link,
    android-libboringssl 14.0.0+r45, from meta-openembedded bb956bf8ff
    (blacksail; the newest android-tools change in it is 255a09ab7f
    "android-tools: fix musl build", on top of b94dcd3256 "android-tools:
    upgrade 29.0.6.r14 -> 35.0.2"). wrynose is still on 5.1.1 (2015), whose
    adbd has no working key authorisation; 35.0.2 has, and LuneOS asks the
    user through it (meta-luneos android-tools_35%.bbappend). blacksail's
    android-tools-conf is the configfs one, which also RPROVIDES
    android-tools-conf-configfs; wrynose's two conf recipes are still there,
    so luneos-preferred-versions.inc names the providers. One change: LICENSE
    uses "&" for "AND", as the SPDX expression form (meta-openembedded
    8f3df8b447) is not parsed by wrynose. Selected with PREFERRED_VERSION in
    meta-luneos's luneos-preferred-versions.inc.

recipes-multimedia/libcamera
    libcamera 0.7.2, from meta-openembedded 3e67d23808 ("libcamera: update
    0.7.1 -> 0.7.2"). wrynose is still on 0.6.0. The PinePhone Pro camera
    fixes are maintained against 0.7.2 and live in the meta-luneos bbappend.

recipes-support/taglib
    taglib 2.3.2, from oe-core 243a679531 ("taglib: upgrade 2.3.1 -> 2.3.2").
    wrynose is still on 2.2.1. One change: LICENSE keeps "|" for "OR", as
    the SPDX expression form (oe-core 36fe911fbe) is not parsed by wrynose.
